<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Explore Fights – bouTime</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Forum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/icon/bouTime.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/icon/bouTime.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .explore-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #242e57 0%, #1a1f3a 100%);
      color: #ffb300;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .explore-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .explore-content {
      min-height: 500px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
    }

    .placeholder-message {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    .placeholder-message h2 {
      color: #242e57;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .placeholder-message p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .features-list {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      text-align: left;
    }

    .features-list h3 {
      color: #242e57;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .features-list ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .features-list li {
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      color: #555;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .features-list li:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .features-list li::before {
      content: "🥊 ";
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    .cta-button {
      background-color: #ffb300;
      color: #242e57;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #ffc533;
      color: #242e57;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .recommendation-note {
      background-color: #e8f4f8;
      border-left: 4px solid #ffb300;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #242e57;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <!-- Explore Header -->
  <div class="explore-header">
    <h1>🥊 Explore Fights</h1>
    <p>Coming Soon – Discover Fights Tailored to You</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Placeholder Content -->
  <div class="explore-content">
    <div class="placeholder-message">
      <h2>Fight Explorer Coming Soon!</h2>
      <p>Get personalized fight recommendations based on your favorite boxers and watch the matches that matter to you.</p>

      <div class="recommendation-note">
        💡 Tip: Set up your boxer profile to unlock personalized fight recommendations!
      </div>

      <div class="features-list">
        <h3>What's Coming to Explore Fights:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Watch fights featuring your favorite boxers</li>
          <li>Get AI-powered fight recommendations</li>
          <li>Browse by weight class or promotion</li>
          <li>Stream live fight events</li>
          <li>Access fight statistics and highlight reels</li>
          <li>Create playlists of your favorite matches</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p>To maximize your recommendations, make sure to <a href="/profile" style="color: #ffb300; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">update your boxer profile</a> with your favorite fighters.</p>

      <a href="/profile" class="cta-button">Set Up Your Profile</a>
      <a href="/home" class="cta-button" style="background-color: transparent; border: 2px solid #ffb300; color: #ffb300; margin-left: 10px;">Continue Shopping</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
